noncomputable section

open EuclideanSpace (positiveOrthant)
open scoped BigOperators SymmetricBox
open Matrix Set

variable {n : ℕ}

/-
Definition 7.35 lies in Chapter 7's orthant-box / diagonal-rounding domain.

Sampled owner-style declarations:
